    "## 3. Laplacianos de Hodge\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\Delta_k=\\underbrace{\\nabla_k\\nabla_k^{T}}_{\\Delta_k^{\\downarrow}=\\partial_k^{T}\\partial_k}+\\underbrace{\\nabla_{k+1}^{T}\\nabla_{k+1}}_{\\Delta_k^{\\uparrow}=\\partial_{k+1}\\partial_{k+1}^{T}}\\qquad\\text{(ec. (4), Def. 1.9)}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Para $k=1$:\n",
    "\n",
    "- $\\Delta_1^{\\downarrow}$ conecta aristas **colineales** que comparten un vértice;\n",
    "- $\\Delta_1^{\\uparrow}$ conecta aristas **paralelas** que comparten una cara (Fig. 5).\n",
    "\n",
    "En el *bulk* $\\Delta_1$ coincide con el Laplaciano de grafo de la ec. (5): diagonal $2d$ y $-1$ hacia los $2d$ vecinos a distancia 1. Como la caja es simplemente conexa, $\\ker\\Delta_1=\\mathcal{H}_1=0$."
   ]
